			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 747020101,
					"content": "喲，最近帶回來不少魚嘛。水族箱也裝點得越來越像那麼一回事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020102,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我們這方面可是很在行的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020103,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們好像很有成就感的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020104,
					"content": "那當然！不過除了成就感之外，總覺得心中有些…有些…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020105,
						747020106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020105,
					"content": "可惜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020107,
					"content": "#對對對，差不多就是{F#妳}{M#你}那個意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020108,
					"content": "這是為什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020109,
					"content": "我也不知道…總覺得這裡還少了什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020110,
						747020112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020110,
					"content": "少了餐廳？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020111,
					"content": "喂！肯定不是啦！這麼漂亮的魚兒怎麼捨得吃啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020114,
					"content": "少的是來欣賞我們成果的客人啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020115,
					"content": "妳的意思是…想讓這個水族館開業接待遊客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020116,
					"content": "妳有什麼顧慮嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020117,
						747020118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020117,
					"content": "怕這裡變得太熱鬧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020119,
					"content": "如果是這樣的話，把經營和宣傳工作交給我們就好！桑多涅妳安心做自己的事，不用操心這邊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020120,
					"content": "#既然{F#妳}{M#你}們都這麼說了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020121,
					"content": "營收額三七分！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020122,
					"content": "欸…？我們才拿七成嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020123,
					"content": "七成是人家的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020124,
					"content": "哦哦…也對，畢竟這船是桑多涅租的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020125,
					"content": "#得了得了，別把我說得像什麼不講道理的地主。{F#妳}{M#你}們出的力，{F#妳}{M#你}們拿大頭。我可沒潘塔羅涅那麼摳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020126,
					"content": "那也就是…妳同意水族館營業了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020127,
					"content": "#嗯，隨{F#妳}{M#你}們弄吧。別吵到我研究就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020128,
					"content": "好欸！維恩歌萊噗噗水族館，開業！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020129,
					"content": "原來早就把名字想好了嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020118,
					"content": "怕事情變得麻煩？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020112,
					"content": "少了客人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747020113,
					"content": "哦！沒錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747020106,
					"content": "孤獨？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747020107
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}